.SS show \f[I]NAME\f[R]
.PP
Show one host, found by name or alias in
any inventory, with every field.
\f[B]-i\f[R] narrows the search to one
inventory.
Values inherited from inventory defaults
are marked \f[B](default)\f[R], and a
group\[aq]s reason shows in parentheses
after it.
.SS add \f[I]NAME\f[R] \f[I]HOSTNAME\f[R]
.PP
Add a host to one inventory:
\f[B]-i\f[R], then
\f[B]ARI_INVENTORY\f[R], then
\f[B]default\f[R] from config.toml.
A value equal to the inventory default
isn\[aq]t stored, so the host follows
the default if it changes.
.PP
.TS
