.TE
.PP
A table for a module that isn\[aq]t
installed is an error, unless it says
\f[B]enabled = false\f[R].
.PP
\f[B]\[ti]/.ssh/config\f[R] pulls the
generated files in with one line, placed
before any Host block:
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
Include config.d/*.conf
\f[R]
.fi
.SH MODULES
.PP
A module turns an inventory into files,
reads a source into hosts, or both.
Modules never write to disk themselves:
they hand \f[B]ari\f[R] paths and
contents, and \f[B]ari\f[R] does the
writing, so the guard, the atomic writes
and the all-or-nothing validation cover
every module the same way.
A host that lists a module in
\f[B]exclude\f[R] never reaches it.
.PP
Modules are found through the Python
entry point group \f[B]ari.modules\f[R].
The built-in \f[B]ssh\f[R] and
\f[B]ansible\f[R] modules register there
like any other.
A third-party module is a package that
registers in that group; install it into
ari\[aq]s environment with \f[B]uv tool
install ari --with\f[R]
\f[I]PACKAGE\f[R].
.SH INVENTORY FILES
.PP
Each inventory is one JSON file.
Hosts store only what differs from the
inventory \f[B]defaults\f[R].
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
{
  \[dq]version\[dq]: 3,
  \[dq]last_updated\[dq]: \[dq]2026-10-02T21:14:00+01:00\[dq],
  \[dq]defaults\[dq]: {\[dq]user\[dq]: \[dq]deploy\[dq], \[dq]keys\[dq]: [\[dq]lab-ed25519\[dq]]},
  \[dq]keys\[dq]: {
    \[dq]lab-ed25519\[dq]: {\[dq]path\[dq]: \[dq]\[ti]/.ssh/lab-ed25519\[dq]},
    \[dq]lab-rsa\[dq]: {\[dq]path\[dq]: \[dq]\[ti]/.ssh/lab-rsa\[dq]}
  },
  \[dq]groups\[dq]: {
    \[dq]zone_app\[dq]: {\[dq]description\[dq]: \[dq]app subnet (192.0.2.0/25)\[dq]},
    \[dq]role_node\[dq]: {\[dq]children\[dq]: [\[dq]role_cluster\[dq], \[dq]role_standalone\[dq]]},
    \[dq]no_auto_update\[dq]: {\[dq]reasons\[dq]: {\[dq]secrets\[dq]: \[dq]secrets and prod path\[dq]}}
  },
  \[dq]hosts\[dq]: [
    {
      \[dq]name\[dq]: \[dq]vault-01\[dq],
      \[dq]hostname\[dq]: \[dq]192.0.2.30\[dq],
      \[dq]aliases\[dq]: [\[dq]vault\[dq]],
      \[dq]notes\[dq]: \[dq]secrets store\[dq],
      \[dq]groups\[dq]: [\[dq]zone_app\[dq], \[dq]no_auto_update\[dq]],
      \[dq]reasons\[dq]: {\[dq]no_auto_update\[dq]: \[dq]secrets\[dq]},
      \[dq]modules\[dq]: {\[dq]ssh\[dq]: {\[dq]options\[dq]: {\[dq]LocalForward\[dq]: [\[dq]8200 localhost:8200\[dq], \[dq]8201 localhost:8201\[dq]]}}},
      \[dq]last_updated\[dq]: \[dq]2026-10-02T21:14:00+01:00\[dq]
    }
  ]
}
\f[R]
.fi
.PP
.TS
tab(@);
lw(24.5n) lw(45.5n).
